  "details": "I would like to see a calibration adjustment menu option that users can click in the quick menu. This option would pop up a clone of your avatar in front of you with all tracker points as objects that can be physically grabbed and moved around for adjustments. \nSliders for controller offsets were a nice addition to the game, but can be confusing and tedious when dealing with a lot of trackers at once, so having the ability to adjust each tracker's offset may need this option if it ever is considered..",
